### Final — Neon Parcel Sorter complete

**Summary:** Polished single-page drag-sort at \`index.html\` — drag or keyboard-sort falling parcels (76×52 desktop → 70×46 mobile) into 4 matching neon tube chutes (Cyan/Magenta/Yellow/Lime) before they hit the floor. Score +100 correct / –1 life wrong/miss, win at 2000 pts, lose at 0 lives (5 hearts), level every 400 pts with escalating theater (progress bar, arena brightness/saturation, scanline & danger pulse acceleration, Level X! pop, rising beeps, bursts 10+level×3).

