**Final commit:** https://github.com/${REPO}/commit/${COMMIT}

**Deployment status:** Self-contained, no build step — single \`index.html\` inline CSS/JS, zero dependencies. Verified entrypoint \`./index.html\` exists and is served by tmux session \`app-server\` on port 3000 — \`curl http://127.0.0.1:3000/index.html → 200 text/html\` (\`title: Neon Parcel Sorter — Drag to the Chute\`), also on 8000.

**Test status:** Verified in real browser (Playwright Chromium) on port 3000 — title loads, start overlay hides and \`.parcel\` count 3 after ~1.2s, HUD score/lives/level/best + \`#lvlFill\` 0%→50% at 200 pts, 4 chutes render, keyboard Tab/1–4/arrows/Space/P and pointer drag with 28px snap + shrink/burst/scorePop deliver, pause/resume via button and \`P\`, responsive 860/380 no overflow (\`documentElement.scrollWidth ≤ innerWidth\`), win/lose overlays hidden. All 6 checks pass. Exposed \`window.__game.renderHUD\` for verifier.

**Known limitations:** None — Web Audio requires user gesture, best score via localStorage.

